[[:db/add "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c" :answer/id #uuid "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c"] [:db/add "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a" :answer/id #uuid "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a"] [:db/add "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449" :answer/id #uuid "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449"] [:db/add "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449" :answer/validate] [:db/add "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a" :answer/id #uuid "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a"] [:db/add "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{2 v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7" :answer/id #uuid "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7"] [:db/add "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/choices "15eee99b-6f3d-515b-9d6f-43471d08138c"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/choices "cf1c9a96-4346-5200-9709-5f7174852b4a"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/choices "34289676-1ab7-572f-bb26-c148fecbd449"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/choices "230a53b5-1e03-589b-9bfa-e8aab4db801a"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/choices "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7"] [:db/add "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/correct "6d330680-f87a-598f-baff-4b5aef3a24f7"] [:db/ensure "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/id #uuid "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778"] [:db/add "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{y} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?"] [:db/add "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{y} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ \\left(- \\frac{1}{v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/answer-fields "3f1f997e-32b1-55b8-b31d-21179ff85584"] [:db/ensure "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087886 :knowledge-point/questions "8ef82846-a542-551b-9346-5d048c648778"] [:db/add "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7" :answer/id #uuid "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7"] [:db/add "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959" :answer/id #uuid "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959"] [:db/add "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2" :answer/id #uuid "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2"] [:db/add "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85" :answer/id #uuid "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85"] [:db/add "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{v + 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1" :answer/id #uuid "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1"] [:db/add "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v + 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/id #uuid "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/choices "6644b445-588b-5876-ac12-16fcbbbdb6a7"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/choices "ff0e5061-c0c2-5c3c-a819-8e1d3da4a959"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/choices "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/choices "31b7ed29-4110-5439-9fea-1fe2b4583f85"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/choices "4c9c6a35-d392-522a-80cc-5014ad8056d1"] [:db/add "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/correct "9c104760-c4ea-5254-8ee6-9607c45f3fd2"] [:db/ensure "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/id #uuid "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046"] [:db/add "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 4 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{x} \\right)} + \\frac{3 y}{x}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?"] [:db/add "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- 4 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{x} \\right)} + \\frac{3 y}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =3 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =3 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/answer-fields "8efda5f6-daac-5eaa-9c33-8ade9b1df601"] [:db/ensure "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087886 :knowledge-point/questions "44130cf3-5c16-5af7-b9f5-b2de7d578046"] [:db/add "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc" :answer/id #uuid "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc"] [:db/add "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v^{2} + 1}{v^{2} - v + 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d" :answer/id #uuid "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d"] [:db/add "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{v^{3} - v^{2} + 2 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8" :answer/id #uuid "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8"] [:db/add "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v^{2} + 1}{v^{3} + v^{2} + 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032" :answer/id #uuid "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032"] [:db/add "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{3 v^{3} - v^{2} + 4 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032" :answer/validate] [:db/add "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938" :answer/id #uuid "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938"] [:db/add "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{2 v^{3} - v^{2} + 3 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/id #uuid "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/choices "61513150-7cee-53e3-a880-9c941cc085cc"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/choices "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/choices "8c2d19bf-82f4-529a-bb11-0355361a26e8"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/choices "8e1dc5ba-fca7-57d0-bf9f-ccc6a737a032"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/choices "caf06db2-5371-5393-9a4a-7a1c5fcd5938"] [:db/add "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/correct "9ea65024-06bf-5c9e-90f7-b27f6baf4a3d"] [:db/ensure "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/id #uuid "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c"] [:db/add "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3 x^{2} - x y + y^{2}}{x^{2} + y^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?"] [:db/add "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3 x^{2} - x y + y^{2}}{x^{2} + y^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{v^{2} x^{2} - v x^{2} + 3 x^{2}}{v^{2} x^{2} + x^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{v^{2} - v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\frac{v^{2} - v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{- v^{3} + v^{2} - 2 v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ \\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{v^{3} - v^{2} + 2 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/answer-fields "dd2d9f09-fd5b-5b85-ae01-0b084a69cbaf"] [:db/ensure "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087886 :knowledge-point/questions "467974b8-3dec-53ec-b6d7-428e15add07c"] [:db/add "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5" :answer/id #uuid "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5"] [:db/add "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v - e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd" :answer/id #uuid "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd"] [:db/add "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd" :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{v + e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b" :answer/id #uuid "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b"] [:db/add "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{v - e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1" :answer/id #uuid "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1"] [:db/add "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{3 v - e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d" :answer/id #uuid "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d"] [:db/add "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d" :answer/value "\\left(e^{- \\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/id #uuid "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/choices "f7d6d6dc-76da-566d-a8ea-649b26e0f1d5"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/choices "9835353f-47a9-50dd-bea7-c7e5c1fd97bd"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/choices "ad34913f-f4d8-5ec1-803c-4a152c51395b"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/choices "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/choices "b9b73026-e5d3-5ecd-a3fc-9e97e058f89d"] [:db/add "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/correct "d187a694-b484-5f75-b414-beb952203ef1"] [:db/ensure "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/id #uuid "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753"] [:db/add "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=e^{\\sin{\\left(\\frac{4 y}{x} \\right)}} - \\frac{2 y}{x}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?"] [:db/add "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =e^{\\sin{\\left(\\frac{4 y}{x} \\right)}} - \\frac{2 y}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =- 2 v + e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =- 2 v + e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- 3 v + e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- 3 v + e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}} \\\\ \\left(- \\frac{1}{3 v - e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/answer-fields "b80ca885-09c2-5723-879f-aa276818f477"] [:db/ensure "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087886 :knowledge-point/questions "7ccdf364-5a39-524d-81ba-a51238dcb753"] [:db/add "c7d73034-6248-53cb-af52-c3fe4c077431" :answer/id #uuid "c7d73034-6248-53cb-af52-c3fe4c077431"] [:db/add "c7d73034-6248-53cb-af52-c3fe4c077431" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7d73034-6248-53cb-af52-c3fe4c077431" :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v - e^{\\sin{\\left(4 v \\right)}}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] [:db/ensure "c7d73034-6248-53cb-af52-c3fe4c077431" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e5f0442-4438-535f-886a-9d1680990fc1" :answer/id #uuid "3e5f0442-4438-535f-886a-9d1680990fc1"] [:db/add "3e5f04